    q: 'Does my size change if I order a Wide fitting?',
    a: "No. Width and length are separate. If you wear a 9 in medium, you order a 9 in Wide or Extra Wide. The extra room comes from the width designation, not from a longer shoe. This is why sizing up to fix tightness across the ball of the foot rarely works: it adds length you don't need without adding much width where you do.",
